// PlainScript 1.0.363 — terminal and process primitives.
// `terminalWidth()`, `terminalHeight()`, `clearTerminal()` and `stderr(...)`
// are CLI helpers. Error text goes to stderr so stdout stays clean.

stderr("starting terminal census")
show "width: " + terminalWidth()
show "height: " + terminalHeight()
stderr("clearing screen")
clearTerminal()
show "screen cleared"
stderr("done")